{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1077217-mage-cocktails","id":1077217,"title":"Mage Cocktails","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-12T14:23:51-07:00","id":1077217,"title":"Mage Cocktails","content":"Anyone who mixes drinks around here?<br /> I was looking online at Geeky Cocktails and thought I'd try my hand at a mage version and realized I'd probably make some terrible drinks.<br /> <br /> What came to mind:<br /> A Traditions drink made up of 9 different flavors that don't quite get along.<br /> Verbena, Mead, &amp; Crab Apple Wassail for the Verbena<br /> Multiple Illegal substance Cult of Ecstasy drink<br /> Dreamspeaker Iboga juice<br /> <br /> I was wondering if maybe people here had better ideas or were interested in it.<br /> I'll probably come up with better stuff eventually<br /> I was just wondering if there was anyone here who actually knows their drinks and can maybe lend a hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T05:37:03-07:00","id":1077651,"title":"","content":"I was not mature enough to handle a drink called Vulgar Effect back at M20 launch, and I'm not now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T14:11:08-07:00","id":1077915,"title":"","content":"Now that I am almost properly awake and not inebriated, I find myself thinking that these guys are probably really a terrible group to base good drinks on.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Akashic Brotherhood would probably get something like a mix of Kung Fu energy drink and traditional snake wine or else some non-alcoholic tonic of green tea, ginseng, and ginko biloba extract; I'm having trouble imagining the Celestial Chorus having something not based on Mompo; and I can't even imagine what Iteration X or Progenitor drinks should taste like.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T14:14:01-07:00","id":1077916,"title":"","content":"Order of Hermes is totally an Old fashioned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T15:52:26-07:00","id":1077983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1077217-mage-cocktails?p=1077651#post1077651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was not mature enough to handle a drink called Vulgar Effect back at M20 launch, and I'm not now.</div> </div> </div> </div>What was in a Vulgar Effect?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12930-gogariglenross","name":"GogariGlenRoss","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-13T16:17:18-07:00","id":1078008,"title":"","content":"<b>Syndicate</b>: Bloody Mary for breakfast on a weekday morning. Dry vodka martini at lunch. Evening? Scotch with ice. None of this cocktail foolishness. <br /> <b>Iteration X: </b>a vaportini (look it up)<br /> <b>Progenitors</b> drink beer, preferably unfiltered\u2014they like their booze to be alive. Either that or the kind of tequila with the worm in it. <br /> <br /> The Progenitor player in my playgroup knows a cocktail called the Mox Sapphire, which is a mini-bottle of gin dumped into a 12oz can of Moxie. Drink the cocktail from the can. (I don't recommend this.) <br /> <br /> <b>Euthanatos</b>: Death in the Afternoon (absinthe+champagne)<br /> <br /> Absinthe is probably the answer to a lot of Traditions drinks, actually.","signature":"","edited":